{"id":"reference/while","kind":"langref","title":"while","sourceUrl":"https://ziglang.org/documentation/0.17.0/#while","file":"reference/while.json","headings":[{"depth":2,"slug":"while","text":"while"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Labeled-while","text":"带标签的 while"},{"depth":3,"slug":"while-with-Optionals","text":"对可选值使用 while"},{"depth":3,"slug":"while-with-Error-Unions","text":"对错误联合使用 while"},{"depth":3,"slug":"inline-while","text":"inline while"}],"html":"<h2 id=\"while\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/while/#while\">while</a></h2>\n\n      <p>while 循环反复执行一个表达式，直到某个条件不再为真。</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_while.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectEqual = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>).testing.expectEqual;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"while basic\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> i: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">while</span> (i &lt; <span class=\"tok-number\">10</span>) {\n        i += <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>;\n    }\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">10</span>, i);\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_while.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_while.test.while basic...OK\nAll 1 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>使用 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">break</span></code> 提前退出 while 循环。</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_while_break.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectEqual = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>).testing.expectEqual;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"while break\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> i: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">while</span> (<span class=\"tok-null\">true</span>) {\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">if</span> (i == <span class=\"tok-number\">10</span>)\n            <span class=\"tok-kw\">break</span>;\n        i += <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>;\n    }\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">10</span>, i);\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_while_break.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_while_break.test.while break...OK\nAll 1 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>使用 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">continue</span></code> 跳回循环开头。</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_while_continue.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectEqual = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>).testing.expectEqual;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"while continue\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> i: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">while</span> (<span class=\"tok-null\">true</span>) {\n        i += <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>;\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">if</span> (i &lt; <span class=\"tok-number\">10</span>)\n            <span class=\"tok-kw\">continue</span>;\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">break</span>;\n    }\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">10</span>, i);\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_while_continue.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_while_continue.test.while continue...OK\nAll 1 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>while 循环支持继续表达式，每次继续下一轮循环时执行。<code><span class=\"tok-kw\">continue</span></code> 关键字也会遵循此规则。</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_while_continue_expression.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectEqual = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>).testing.expectEqual;\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expect = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>).testing.expect;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"while loop continue expression\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> i: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">while</span> (i &lt; <span class=\"tok-number\">10</span>) : (i += <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>) {}\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">10</span>, i);\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"while loop continue expression, more complicated\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> i: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> j: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">while</span> (i * j &lt; <span class=\"tok-number\">2000</span>) : ({\n        i *= <span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>;\n        j *= <span class=\"tok-number\">3</span>;\n    }) {\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> my_ij = i * j;\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expect(my_ij &lt; <span class=\"tok-number\">2000</span>);\n    }\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_while_continue_expression.zig</kbd>\n1/2 test_while_continue_expression.test.while loop continue expression...OK\n2/2 test_while_continue_expression.test.while loop continue expression, more complicated...OK\nAll 2 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>while 循环是表达式。其结果是 while 循环的 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">else</span></code> 子句的结果；当循环条件判断为假时执行该子句。</p>\n      <p><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">break</span></code> 与 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span></code> 一样接受一个值参数，该值就是 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">while</span></code> 表达式的结果。从 while 循环中执行 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">break</span></code> 时，不会求值 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">else</span></code> 分支。</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_while_else.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expect = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>).testing.expect;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"while else\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expect(rangeHasNumber(<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">10</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">5</span>));\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expect(!rangeHasNumber(<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">10</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">15</span>));\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">rangeHasNumber</span>(begin: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span>, end: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span>, number: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span>) <span class=\"tok-type\">bool</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> i = begin;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">while</span> (i &lt; end) : (i += <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>) {\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">if</span> (i == number) {\n            <span class=\"tok-kw\">break</span> <span class=\"tok-null\">true</span>;\n        }\n    } <span class=\"tok-kw\">else</span> <span class=\"tok-null\">false</span>;\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_while_else.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_while_else.test.while else...OK\nAll 1 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <h3 id=\"Labeled-while\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/while/#Labeled-while\">带标签的 while</a></h3>\n\n      <p>为 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">while</span></code> 循环添加标签后，可以在嵌套循环中通过 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">break</span></code> 或 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">continue</span></code> 引用它：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_while_nested_break.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"nested break\"</span> {\n    outer: <span class=\"tok-kw\">while</span> (<span class=\"tok-null\">true</span>) {\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">while</span> (<span class=\"tok-null\">true</span>) {\n            <span class=\"tok-kw\">break</span> :outer;\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"nested continue\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> i: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>;\n    outer: <span class=\"tok-kw\">while</span> (i &lt; <span class=\"tok-number\">10</span>) : (i += <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>) {\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">while</span> (<span class=\"tok-null\">true</span>) {\n            <span class=\"tok-kw\">continue</span> :outer;\n        }\n    }\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_while_nested_break.zig</kbd>\n1/2 test_while_nested_break.test.nested break...OK\n2/2 test_while_nested_break.test.nested continue...OK\nAll 2 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      \n      <h3 id=\"while-with-Optionals\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/while/#while-with-Optionals\">对可选值使用 while</a></h3>\n\n      <p>与 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/if/#if\">if</a> 表达式一样，while 循环可以将可选值作为条件并捕获载荷。遇到 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Optionals/#null\">null</a> 时循环退出。</p>\n      <p>当 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">while</span></code> 表达式使用 <code>|x|</code> 语法时，其循环条件必须具有<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Optionals/#Optional-Type\">可选类型</a>。</p>\n      <p>遍历可选值时允许使用 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">else</span></code> 分支；它会在首次遇到空值时执行。</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_while_null_capture.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectEqual = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>).testing.expectEqual;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"while null capture\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> sum1: <span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>;\n    numbers_left = <span class=\"tok-number\">3</span>;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">while</span> (eventuallyNullSequence()) |value| {\n        sum1 += value;\n    }\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">3</span>, sum1);\n\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 使用 else 块处理空值</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> sum2: <span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>;\n    numbers_left = <span class=\"tok-number\">3</span>;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">while</span> (eventuallyNullSequence()) |value| {\n        sum2 += value;\n    } <span class=\"tok-kw\">else</span> {\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">3</span>, sum2);\n    }\n\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 带有继续表达式的可选值捕获</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> i: <span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> sum3: <span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>;\n    numbers_left = <span class=\"tok-number\">3</span>;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">while</span> (eventuallyNullSequence()) |value| : (i += <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>) {\n        sum3 += value;\n    }\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">3</span>, i);\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> numbers_left: <span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span> = <span class=\"tok-null\">undefined</span>;\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">eventuallyNullSequence</span>() ?<span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">if</span> (numbers_left == <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>) <span class=\"tok-null\">null</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">else</span> blk: {\n        numbers_left -= <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>;\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">break</span> :blk numbers_left;\n    };\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_while_null_capture.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_while_null_capture.test.while null capture...OK\nAll 1 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      \n\n      <h3 id=\"while-with-Error-Unions\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/while/#while-with-Error-Unions\">对错误联合使用 while</a></h3>\n\n      <p>与 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/if/#if\">if</a> 表达式一样，while 循环可以将错误联合作为条件，并捕获载荷或错误码。条件产生错误码时，会求值 else 分支并结束循环。</p>\n      <p>当 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">while</span></code> 表达式使用 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">else</span> |x|</code> 语法时，其循环条件必须具有<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Errors/#Error-Union-Type\">错误联合类型</a>。</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_while_error_capture.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectEqual = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>).testing.expectEqual;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"while error union capture\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> sum1: <span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>;\n    numbers_left = <span class=\"tok-number\">3</span>;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">while</span> (eventuallyErrorSequence()) |value| {\n        sum1 += value;\n    } <span class=\"tok-kw\">else</span> |err| {\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>.ReachedZero, err);\n    }\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> numbers_left: <span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span> = <span class=\"tok-null\">undefined</span>;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">eventuallyErrorSequence</span>() <span class=\"tok-type\">anyerror</span>!<span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">if</span> (numbers_left == <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>) <span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>.ReachedZero <span class=\"tok-kw\">else</span> blk: {\n        numbers_left -= <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>;\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">break</span> :blk numbers_left;\n    };\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_while_error_capture.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_while_error_capture.test.while error union capture...OK\nAll 1 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      \n\n      <h3 id=\"inline-while\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/while/#inline-while\">inline while</a></h3>\n\n      <p>while 循环可以内联。内联会展开循环，使代码能够执行仅在编译时可行的操作，例如将类型作为一等值使用。</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_inline_while.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectEqual = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>).testing.expectEqual;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"inline while loop\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">comptime</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> i = <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> sum: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">inline</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">while</span> (i &lt; <span class=\"tok-number\">3</span>) : (i += <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>) {\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> T = <span class=\"tok-kw\">switch</span> (i) {\n            <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span> =&gt; <span class=\"tok-type\">f32</span>,\n            <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span> =&gt; <span class=\"tok-type\">i8</span>,\n            <span class=\"tok-number\">2</span> =&gt; <span class=\"tok-type\">bool</span>,\n            <span class=\"tok-kw\">else</span> =&gt; <span class=\"tok-kw\">unreachable</span>,\n        };\n        sum += typeNameLength(T);\n    }\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">9</span>, sum);\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">typeNameLength</span>(<span class=\"tok-kw\">comptime</span> T: <span class=\"tok-type\">type</span>) <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@typeName</span>(T).len;\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_inline_while.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_inline_while.test.inline while loop...OK\nAll 1 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>建议仅在以下情况之一成立时使用 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">inline</span></code> 循环：</p>\n      <ul>\n        <li>需要循环在<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/comptime/#comptime\">编译时</a>执行，才能实现所需语义。</li>\n        <li>已有基准测试证明，以这种方式强制展开循环会带来可测量的性能提升。</li>\n      </ul>\n      \n      <p>另见：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/if/#if\">if</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Optionals/#Optionals\">可选值</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Errors/#Errors\">错误</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/comptime/#comptime\">comptime</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/unreachable/#unreachable\">unreachable</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n      \n      ","translation":{"total":38,"translated":38}}
